@startuml NovaMarket_Order_Saga_Inventory_Failure
title Sequence Diagram: Inventory Reservation Failure (Compensation Flow)

actor Buyer as buyer
participant "Mobile App" as app
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Order Service" as order
participant "Inventory Service" as inventory
participant "Notification Service" as notification
participant "Message Broker" as broker

== Step 1: Create Order ==
buyer -> app: Оформить заказ
app -> gateway: POST /orders
gateway -> order: CreateOrderCommand
order -> broker: Publish OrderCreated
order --> gateway: OrderCreated (201)
gateway --> app: Order ID

== Step 2: Inventory Reservation Fails ==
broker -> inventory: Consume OrderCreated
inventory -> inventory: Check availability
note over inventory: Товар недоступен\nна складе
inventory -> broker: Publish InventoryReservationFailed

== Step 3: Cancel Order ==
broker -> order: Consume InventoryReservationFailed
order -> order: Update status to CANCELLED
order -> broker: Publish OrderCancelled

== Step 4: Notify Buyer ==
broker -> notification: Consume InventoryReservationFailed
notification -> buyer: Push: Товар недоступен
broker -> notification: Consume OrderCancelled
notification -> buyer: Push: Заказ отменён
notification -> broker: Publish NotificationSent

note over buyer, broker: Order cancelled - items not available

@enduml